# Recent (source/screens/games.c, mockup #11) in the light theme: the two
# games of the card's v0.3 list, each with its console mark; their times
# weren't kept (as for games played while the clock isn't set, T4), so no
# row says when it was played. DOWN moves the pill. (tests/games.sh checks
# Recent after a launch, and its "played" texts following the clock.)
#! settings 28=1
-w "nav: home ready"
-k @8:A -k @12:-
-w "nav: page recent ready"
-s @2:screen.png
-k @8:DOWN -k @12:-
-s @30:down.png
